---
---

<section id="origin" class="py-24 bg-white text-black border-t border-black">
  <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">

    <!-- Headline Statement in GoodBoyBob Text Layout Style -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700 font-bold block mb-3">
        Our Core Mission
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-[0.95] mb-8">
        WE ELEVATE COFFEE FROM A DAILY ROUTINE TO AN <span class="font-serif italic font-normal text-amber-800">EXTRAORDINARY ART FORM.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-800 font-sans">
        Whether you are experiencing a pour-over at our Turrialba volcanic estate or brewing our single-origin micro-lots at home across the world, our objective is singular: uncompromising quality, transparent origin, and relentless innovation in every cup.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Side-by-Side Overlay Media Section in GoodBoyBob Style -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-16">

      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="relative group overflow-hidden bg-black text-white min-h-[500px] flex flex-col justify-end p-8 sm:p-12">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511537190424-bbbab87ac5eb?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Turrialba Volcanic Estate"
          loading="lazy"
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-75 transition-all duration-700 filter contrast-110"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/40 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-300 font-bold block mb-2">
            Terroir & Elevation
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">
            Volcanic Soil Chemistry
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-light mb-6 max-w-lg leading-relaxed">
            High above the mist line on the mineral-laden slopes of Turrialba Volcano, slow maturation concentrates complex fruit sugars and elegant floral acidity in every cherry.
          </p>
          <a href="#timeline" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-white text-black font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black hover:bg-amber-400 transition-colors">
            Discover Process &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="relative group overflow-hidden bg-black text-white min-h-[500px] flex flex-col justify-end p-8 sm:p-12">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497515114629-f71d768fd07c?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Coffee Roasting Precision"
          loading="lazy"
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-75 transition-all duration-700 filter contrast-110"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/40 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-300 font-bold block mb-2">
            Craftsmanship
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">
            Micro-Batch Roasting
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-light mb-6 max-w-lg leading-relaxed">
            Every harvest lot is custom-profiled and roasted in 2kg batches with thermal precision, preserving delicate varietal aromatics and vibrant origin characteristics.
          </p>
          <a href="#menu" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-amber-400 text-black font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black hover:bg-white transition-colors">
            Shop Micro-Lots &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
